    {
      "id": "u_f3d0dcd4621190d240284924_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A branch describes the placement of a note within the note tree. Essentially, it is a tuple of __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and __TRILIUM_PH_1__, indicating that the given note is placed as a child under the specified parent note.",
      "sourceHash": "f3d0dcd4621190d2402849246b01fa06f3e1e526d8690773c0000c166766b9a9",
      "context": "Tree Concepts > Branch",
      "contextHash": "ab1a872c0239d1eb28e52a39659e4effc03cf510337da2c15f7b26fec9c951a8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8164e9a7cc78179638606efd_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Each note can have multiple branches, meaning any note can be placed in multiple locations within the tree. This concept is referred to as __TRILIUM_PH_0__Cloning Notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "8164e9a7cc78179638606efdb433a346adc914f50e9f4c933879bdc63e4f4643",
      "context": "Tree Concepts > Branch",
      "contextHash": "ab1a872c0239d1eb28e52a39659e4effc03cf510337da2c15f7b26fec9c951a8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_01fac19d0083763091d749fa_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Prefix__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "01fac19d0083763091d749fa76a7f9702e4092e58b47ddabc5a9d547f1395653",
      "context": "Tree Concepts > Prefix",
      "contextHash": "5c29959b3e6b9499f809a1300c264b839879e143cc44b8d116722e3bd1c08d37",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_180c7e97334c6ec1944c44e7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A prefix is a branch-specific title modifier for a note. If you place your note in two different locations within the tree and want to alter the title slightly in one of those placements, you can use a prefix.",
      "sourceHash": "180c7e97334c6ec1944c44e7390d2a135a62b243475073fa529e234f34da629b",
      "context": "Tree Concepts > Prefix",
      "contextHash": "5c29959b3e6b9499f809a1300c264b839879e143cc44b8d116722e3bd1c08d37",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0994acb5cb179f9ef838c55d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To edit a prefix, right-click on the note in the tree pane and select __TRILIUM_PH_0__Edit branch prefix__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "0994acb5cb179f9ef838c55d90bddab4df37c3f0f197f6e208f1c9c56ab36f60",
      "context": "Tree Concepts > Prefix",
      "contextHash": "5c29959b3e6b9499f809a1300c264b839879e143cc44b8d116722e3bd1c08d37",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_db8a8621109853435a192d38_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The prefix is not part of the note itself and is not encrypted when the note is protected. This can be useful if you want part of the title to remain visible in the tree for easier navigation, even when the note is protected.",
      "sourceHash": "db8a8621109853435a192d389f01148ab615d2db24ae8939248e0886941a93a5",
      "context": "Tree Concepts > Prefix",
      "contextHash": "5c29959b3e6b9499f809a1300c264b839879e143cc44b8d116722e3bd1c08d37",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
